    "video_script": "Yamal turned seventeen. Then, a European final. Berlin. Spain against England. Euro final. He became the youngest Euro finalist ever. Seventeen years and one day old. Yamal got behind Shaw and crossed low. Nico Williams scored in the forty-seventh minute. Cole Palmer equalised in the seventy-third. Oyarzabal won it in the eighty-sixth. Spain won two-one, a record fourth title. He also broke Pele's age record. He won Young Player of the Tournament. Greatest teenage final performance ever?",
